      "note": "Round coarse estimate to 0.98 g/mL. Ambrox apparent specific volume 1.000 mL/g is an explicit unmeasured modelling assumption, not a literature crystal density. Ethanol component uses the 96% reference proxy; actual concentration unresolved. No excess volume, dissolution contraction, precipitation or phase separation is modelled. Highest-priority density calibration."
    },
